  "_note": "Random-init LimiX fixture (Apache-2.0 architecture, our weights). ONE weights file serves both tasks. H is DYNAMIC; y carries train targets only (length = train_size); no cat_mask/d/train_size inputs. The model standardises features itself and the wrapper standardises the regression target in-graph, so the engine profile is *_raw. classification outputs are class logits (C = max_classes); regression outputs are a SINGLE RAW-space point estimate (C = 1). Rows < S are in-context fitted values (context rows presented a second time as queries)."
